    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d257">

                <pb facs="1308" n="1150" xml:id="pg1150"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic">July 23,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Diaz is deeply appreciative for the early action in Sonora frontier gun
                    and ammunition matter and cordially thanks President Roosevelt for this and his
                    expressed sentiments on the subject.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
